The S&amp;P 500 closed at 7,744, up 0.3%, the NASDAQ composite closed at 26,713, up 0.1%.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.020
That index is up 14.97% year to date, and up 19.39% since inception.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:55.620
The TSX composite closed at 36,137, up 1.6% with materials leading on a gold price rebound.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.640
Chip stocks extended their sell-off while that Canadian advance ran.

