00:01:22.586 --> 00:01:29.126
The Hamilton Enhance Canadian Covered Call, ETF, ticker HDIV, generates monthly income

00:01:29.126 --> 00:01:33.926
by selling out-of-the-money calls against a basket of Canadian equities, according to

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:35.066
the Motley Fool Canada.

00:01:35.746 --> 00:01:39.146
Think of a covered call like renting out a parking spot on your property.

00:01:39.146 --> 00:01:42.686
You still own the land, you just collect rent while it sits there.

00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:49.806
In this stretch of moderating guaranteed investment certificate or GIC renewal rates, the 9.8%

00:01:49.806 --> 00:01:54.186
indicated yield is a concrete alternative for income-focused accounts that can live

00:01:54.186 --> 00:01:57.686
with caped upside and with drawdowns when equities rally.

00:01:58.286 --> 00:02:05.386
You can implement it in a TFSA or an RRSP by buying HDIV on the TSX and holding through

00:02:05.386 --> 00:02:10.206
the monthly distribution cycle, or you can replicate the same mechanics on a single name

00:02:10.206 --> 00:02:15.786
using your broker's options chain. The structure has historically done its best work in range bound

00:02:15.786 --> 00:02:22.106
or modestly rising markets, where volatility actually pays you to collect premium. It underperformed

00:02:22.106 --> 00:02:27.526
sharply in a strong trending bull market, because those calls get exercised away and you lose the

00:02:27.526 --> 00:02:33.046
upside you sold. Risk management means watching the underlying equity exposure and being ready to

00:02:33.046 --> 00:02:35.926
take assignment or roll the calls if the market jumps.

00:02:36.466 --> 00:02:41.406
Those monthly payments line up with cash flow needs that used to sit in five-year GICs

00:02:41.406 --> 00:02:43.566
now coming up for renewal at lower rates.

00:02:44.146 --> 00:02:49.566
Compare that 9.8% yield straight against the GIC quote on your screen and decide whether

00:02:49.566 --> 00:02:51.726
the equity risk premium is worth the move.

00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:58.903
Brookfield Corp ticker BN on the TSX is this week's simulated weekly hold, the same name

00:02:58.903 --> 00:03:01.463
that opened the show and no real money is involved.

00:03:01.463 --> 00:03:08.023
The strategy is a valuation entry on continued capital deployment capacity, held for five sessions

00:03:08.023 --> 00:03:10.303
from entry inside the financial sector.

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:16.303
Price action is recovering from earlier 2026 highs near $80 Canadian dollars, and the

00:03:16.303 --> 00:03:21.223
technical check is where that price sits versus the 50-day moving average, plus volume

00:03:21.223 --> 00:03:22.663
versus the 20-day average.

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:28.543
Acquisition-related capital raises could pressure near-term free cash flow, so the stop loss

00:03:28.543 --> 00:03:31.603
costs is set at 8% below entry before the trade is on.

00:03:32.063 --> 00:03:37.083
The five-session target is plus 3% to plus 6% if earnings momentum holds.

00:03:37.603 --> 00:03:38.703
Confidence is medium.

00:03:39.263 --> 00:03:44.343
The fundamental anchor is clear, but sector rotation into financials is still unconfirmed

00:03:44.343 --> 00:03:49.183
by volume, and that volume confirmation filter is why this does not get a higher grade.

00:03:50.003 --> 00:03:51.283
Invalidation is explicit.

00:03:51.843 --> 00:03:56.843
Distributable earnings growth falls below 10% on the next quarterly update, or the stock

00:03:56.843 --> 00:03:59.923
closes below the 50-day moving average on the daily chart.

00:04:00.483 --> 00:04:02.103
Copy that in validation habit.

00:04:02.643 --> 00:04:05.643
Name what proves the thesis wrong before a dollar is at risk.

00:04:06.635 --> 00:04:11.455
Valuation discipline here means translating one earnings metric into a rules-based entry,

00:04:11.955 --> 00:04:16.575
respecting sector concentration, and separating the headline growth print from the capital

00:04:16.575 --> 00:04:19.175
deployment story that actually compounds value.

00:04:19.615 --> 00:04:24.855
While this simulated hold is running, open your platform, pull up BN, and calculate the

00:04:24.855 --> 00:04:28.935
The implied annualized yield if you sold the nearest out-of-the-money covered call that

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:33.895
expires in 30 days, then note whether that yield exceeds your current cash allocation

00:04:33.895 --> 00:04:34.155
rate.

00:04:35.146 --> 00:04:37.706
No simulated hold closed since the last review.

00:04:38.386 --> 00:04:43.026
The most recent practice investment has already been scored, and current holdings stay open

00:04:43.026 --> 00:04:44.486
until their scheduled evaluation.

00:04:45.246 --> 00:04:50.566
Five session holds enter at the next open and exit on the stop or the horizon, with no

00:04:50.566 --> 00:04:52.006
discretionary early exits.

00:04:52.006 --> 00:04:55.126
benefits, so there is no new realized result to report today.

00:04:55.626 --> 00:04:58.746
We wait on the clock rather than rewriting the thesis midweek.

