00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:45.500
Taiwan is preparing multiple industrial parks in the United States to support smaller suppliers

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.940
to TSMC and Foxconn in the NVIDIA supply chain.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:55.560
