00:07:04.216 --> 00:07:11.116
The method is still learning from that volume confirmation misrate and tightening the filter rather than chasing the last winner.

00:07:11.656 --> 00:07:21.736
You hold Enbridge in a TFA and need to know whether the bot deal and the US acquisition spend have knocked your weights off target, which is the review the Motley Fool Canada walk through.

00:07:22.296 --> 00:07:31.016
Export the holdings into a spreadsheet and calculate each position as a percentage of total portfolio value using current market prices, not cost basis.

00:07:31.016 --> 00:07:37.176
Endbridge trades near $66 Canadian dollars after raising roughly $3 billion in a bot deal

00:07:37.176 --> 00:07:42.876
to fund US pipeline and utility acquisitions that now total more than $3 billion US dollars

00:07:42.876 --> 00:07:47.576
on top of the earlier $14 billion US dollars of natural gas utility purchases.

00:07:48.016 --> 00:07:52.656
Compare those weights against your stated targets and mark any drift above or below your

00:07:52.656 --> 00:07:53.536
tolerance bands.

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:58.916
Calculate time-weighted returns by isolating each cash flow date and applying the matching

00:07:58.916 --> 00:08:04.676
growth factor, then split realized versus unrealized gains, so tax-loss harvesting candidates

00:08:04.676 --> 00:08:06.076
show up before year end.

00:08:06.596 --> 00:08:11.496
Track the trailing 12-month dividend income trends separately, because Enbridge has raised

00:08:11.496 --> 00:08:16.816
its dividend in each of the past 31 years while advancing more than $40 billion in secured

00:08:16.816 --> 00:08:22.436
capital projects tied to North American energy demand from AI data centers and LNG exports.

00:08:23.056 --> 00:08:27.216
Subtract every fee paid in the quarter from the gross returns so you are looking at net

00:08:27.216 --> 00:08:33.836
performance, not a vanity number. Rebalance only of drift exceeds your band. Harvest loss is only

00:08:33.836 --> 00:08:39.416
if the tax benefit exceeds transaction cost, and add new capital only to names that still meet

00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:44.376
the original thesis. The misconception is treating that sitting as a performance scorecard.

00:08:44.836 --> 00:08:50.656
It is a rules-based rebalancing and tax-planning pass. Before we wrap, tomorrow is the first session

00:08:50.656 --> 00:08:55.876
of the simulated Brookfield hold, and the volume versus 20-day average reading is the confirmation

00:08:55.876 --> 00:08:57.856
to mark against the 50-day line.

